      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "bb582ba5-1922-47ab-a300-ae8f5ff3a0bf",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "9e725179-ed75-463d-ac15-062de69202ad",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "313096a1-b00f-445f-a52a-b8f346ee6314",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The lantern shows\nSTEADY, and the\nwritten received\ncard is signed.\nThe backup courier",
                      "is named in the\nlog. Dot reads\nboth before\ndeclaring the\nsignal ready. Pip",
                      "waits for the\nwhole sentence,\nwhich she\nappreciates more\nthan he knows. The",
                      "received launch\ncard also confirms\nthe normal service\nlimit is FOUR. The\nbrief test ceiling",
                      "remains SIX; EIGHT\nremains a damage\nwarning. Dot asks\nyou to carry that\nchecked value to",
                      "the final grid\ninspection, rather\nthan remembering\nthe largest number\non the old plate."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fe2798ff-a1c3-4d8a-aab0-0a72ca7bb921",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "79abd410-85b2-48b9-a871-f0777db75ab9",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "fb23bd78-7522-4850-a56a-2c8d4d5ee4b2",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "d390a0c4-1c4b-4843-a6a0-bdf7f5f5b40a",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "291f6b11-3c0d-4fec-ad31-dd1a3c3cd0d1",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The final\nrehearsal combines\ntwo problems: the\nlodge branch is\nisolated for",
                      "repair, and the\nrelay reply is\nunconfirmed. Other\nbranches remain\nwithin the service",
                      "budget. The\narchive foot route\nis available for\nthe message copy.\nSlush asks if the",
                      "whole launch must\nstop. Dot says the\nplan has separate\nresponses for\nseparate faults;",
                      "the important\nquestion is\nwhether each is\nactually used, not\nwhether the city",
                      "can pretend the\nfaults never\nhappened."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cd48fd87-d69c-429d-abbf-f21164051843",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
